      ******************************************************************        
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.                                                    

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.                                                    
       FILE-CONTROL.                                                            

       DATA DIVISION.                                                           
       FILE SECTION.                                                            

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.                                                 

       01 FILLER.                                                               
          03 FILLER PIC X(40) VALUE 'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SECTION'.           

      *****************************************************                     
      ** SWITCH **                                                              
      *****************************************************                     
          03 SW-SWITCH.                                                         
             05 SW-ERROR-DB2   PIC S9(3)  VALUE  0.                             
                88 DB2-OK                 VALUE  0.                             
                88 DB2-NOTFND             VALUE +100.                           
                88 DB2-DUPLICADO          VALUE -803.                           
                88 DB2-SELECTDUP          VALUE -811.                           

             05 SW-PRIMERA-LECTURA        PIC X  VALUE '0'.                     
                88 NO-PRIMERA-LECTURA            VALUE '1'.                     
                88 PRIMERA-LECTURA               VALUE '0'.                     

      *****************************************************                     
      *   CONTROL PARA SABER SI EL CURSOR SE HA ABIERTO   *                     
      *****************************************************                     

             05 SW-CURSOR-ABIERTO         PIC X  VALUE '0'.                     
                88 NO-CURSOR-OK                  VALUE '1'.                     
                88 CURSOR-OK                     VALUE '0'.                     
      ****************************************************                      
      *   CONTROL DE ERRORES DEL PROGRAMA                                       
      ****************************************************                      
             05 SW-ERRORES                PIC XX VALUE '00'.                    
                88 NO-ERROR                      VALUE '00'.                    
                88 ERROR-GRAVE                   VALUE '01'.                    

      ****************************************************                      
      ** LITERALES                                                              
      ****************************************************                      
          03 LT-LITERALES.                                                      

             05 LT-MODOS-ENTRADA.                                               
                07 LT-MODO-ALTA       PIC X(1)   VALUE 'A'.                     
                07 LT-MODO-BAJA       PIC X(1)   VALUE 'B'.                     
                07 LT-MODO-MODIF      PIC X(1)   VALUE 'M'.                     
                07 LT-MODO-CONSULTA   PIC X(1)   VALUE 'C'.                     
                07 LT-MODO-REGULA     PIC X(2)   VALUE 'R'.                     

             05 LT-ERRORES-RETORNO.                                             
      *         LITERAL NO HAY ERRORES                                          
                07 LT-RETURN-OK             PIC X(5) VALUE '00'.                
      *         ERROR EN MODO                                                   
                07 LT-RETURN-ERR-MODO       PIC X(5) VALUE '01'.                
      *         ERROR FALTAN DATOS INFORMADOS                                   
                07 LT-RETURN-ERR-DATINFO    PIC X(5) VALUE '02'.                
      *         ERROR REGISTRO NO ENCONTRADO                                    
                07 LT-RETURN-ERR-NOTFND     PIC X(5) VALUE '03'.                
      *         ERROR REGISTRO CLAVE DUPLICADA                                  
                07 LT-RETURN-ERR-CLVDUPLI   PIC X(5) VALUE '04'.                
      *         ERROR EN ACCESO A BASE DE DATOS                                 
                07 LT-RETURN-ERR-OTHER      PIC X(5) VALUE '99'.                
      ****************************************************                      
      ** CONTADORES Y CONSTANTES                                                
      ****************************************************                      
          03 XN-CONTADORES.                                                     
             05 XN-I                  PIC 9(2).                                 
             05 XN-J                  PIC 9(2).                                 

          03 CN-CONSTANTES.                                                     
             05 CN-RES-MAX            PIC 9(1) VALUE 6.                         

          03 XN-SQLCODE               PIC X(2).                                 
      ****************************************************                      
      ** AREA DE COMUNICACION CON DB2                                           
      ****************************************************                      
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA     END-EXEC.                                
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE T372CCV0  END-EXEC.                                

      ******************************************************************        
      *CURSOR PARA RECUPERAR LISTADO COMPLETO DE EXPEDIENTES DE RESCATE         
      ******************************************************************        
           EXEC SQL DECLARE C1 CURSOR FOR                                       
           SELECT CCV0_ANIO            ,                                        
                  CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE     ,                                        
                  CCV0_NCOA            ,                                        
                  CCV0_CODCOA          ,                                        
                  CCV0_PORCOA          ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPCOA          ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPRTOINTEGRCOA ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPREDPRICOA    ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPREDTRANCOA   ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPRTONETOCOA   ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPRETCOA       ,                                        
                  CCV0_IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                          
                FROM TB372CCV0                                                  
                WHERE    CCV0_ANIO        = :CCV0-ANIO                          
                  AND    CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE = :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE                   
                  AND    CCV0_NCOA        >= :CCV0-NCOA                         
             ORDER BY CCV0_ANIO,                                                
                      CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE,                                         
                      CCV0_NCOA                                                 
           END-EXEC.                                                            

          03 FILLER PIC X(40) VALUE 'FINAL WORKING-STORAGE SECTION'.            

       LINKAGE SECTION.                                                         
       01 DFHCOMMAREA.                                                          
             COPY X372MCOA.                                                     

      *************************************************************             
      * PROCEDURE DIVISION.                                       *             
      *************************************************************             
      *                                                                         
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DFHCOMMAREA.                                    

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO.                                                 

           IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                   
              PERFORM 2000-PROCESO                                              
           END-IF.                                                              

           PERFORM 9000-FINAL.                                                  

      ******************************************************************        
      * 1000-INICIO                                                    *        
      ******************************************************************        
      *                                                                         
       1000-INICIO.                                                             
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 1000-INICIO.'                                     
      *F*                                                                       
           SET  NO-ERROR     TO TRUE.                                           
           INITIALIZE X372MCOA-S ,                                              
                      DCLTB372CCV0.                                             
           MOVE LT-RETURN-OK TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                              
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: OPERACION ' X372MCOA-OPERACION-E                  
      *F*                                                                       

           IF X372MCOA-OPERACION-E   = SPACES                                   
              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                           
              MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-DATINFO     TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S              
              MOVE 'B372MCOA'                TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S             
              MOVE 'EL CAMPO OPERACION ES OBLIGATORIO'                          
                                             TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                
           END-IF.                                                              

      ******************************************************************        
      * 2000-PROCESO                                                   *        
      ******************************************************************        
      *                                                                         
       2000-PROCESO.                                                            
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2000-PROCESO'                                     
      *F*                                                                       

           EVALUATE X372MCOA-OPERACION-E                                        
               WHEN LT-MODO-ALTA                                                
               WHEN LT-MODO-MODIF                                               
               WHEN LT-MODO-REGULA                                              
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-INI                                                    
                  PERFORM 2200-PROCESO-BAJA                                     
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-FIN                                                    
                  PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1                              
                  UNTIL XN-J > X372MCOA-COASEGUROS-OCCURS-E                     
                  OR X372MCOA-CODCOA-E (XN-J) = SPACES                          
                     PERFORM 8100-INFORMAR-MODIFICA                             
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-INI                                                    
      *               PERFORM 2200-PROCESO-BAJA                                 
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-FIN                                                    
                     PERFORM 2100-PROCESO-ALTA                                  
                  END-PERFORM                                                   
               WHEN LT-MODO-BAJA                                                
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-INI                                                    
      *            PERFORM VARYING XN-J FROM 1 BY 1                             
      *            UNTIL XN-J > X372MCOA-COASEGUROS-OCCURS-E                    
      *            OR X372MCOA-CODCOA-E (XN-J) = SPACES                         
      *               PERFORM 8100-INFORMAR-MODIFICA                            
      *               PERFORM 2200-PROCESO-BAJA                                 
      *            END-PERFORM                                                  
                  PERFORM 2200-PROCESO-BAJA                                     
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-FIN                                                    
               WHEN LT-MODO-CONSULTA                                            
                     PERFORM 2400-PROCESO-CONSULTA                              
               WHEN OTHER                                                       
                    SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                     
                    MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-MODO TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S               
                    MOVE 'B372MCOA'         TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S              
                    MOVE 'EL CAMPO OPERACION ES INCORRECTO'                     
                                            TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                 
           END-EVALUATE.                                                        

      ******************************************************************        
      * 2100-PROCESO-ALTA.                                             *        
      ******************************************************************        
      *                                                                         
       2100-PROCESO-ALTA.                                                       
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: PROCESO-ALTA'                                     
      *F*                                                                       
           EXEC SQL                                                             
              INSERT INTO TB372CCV0                                             
              (                                                                 
               CCV0_ANIO             ,                                          
               CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE      ,                                          
               CCV0_NCOA             ,                                          
               CCV0_CODCOA           ,                                          
               CCV0_PORCOA           ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPCOA           ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPRTOINTEGRCOA  ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPREDPRICOA     ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPREDTRANCOA    ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPRTONETOCOA    ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPRETCOA        ,                                          
               CCV0_IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                             
              )                                                                 
              VALUES                                                            
              (                                                                 
               :CCV0-ANIO            ,                                          
               :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE     ,                                          
               :CCV0-NCOA            ,                                          
               :CCV0-CODCOA          ,                                          
               :CCV0-PORCOA          ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPCOA          ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPRTOINTEGRCOA ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPREDPRICOA    ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPREDTRANCOA   ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPRTONETOCOA   ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPRETCOA       ,                                          
               :CCV0-IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                            
              )                                                                 
           END-EXEC.                                                            

           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.                                        
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'SQLCODE ' SQLCODE                                           
      *F*                                                                       
           IF NOT DB2-OK                                                        

              SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                          
              IF DB2-DUPLICADO                                                  
                 MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-CLVDUPLI      TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S         
                 MOVE 'YA EXISTE UN EXPEDIENTE CON ESTE AÑO/EXPEDIENTE'         
                                                  TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S           
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-OTHER    TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S              
                 MOVE SQLCODE                TO XN-SQLCODE                      
                 MOVE 'ERROR AL INSERTAR EN TB372CCV0'                          
                                             TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                
              END-IF                                                            
           END-IF                                                               
           .                                                                    
      ******************************************************************        
      * 2200-PROCESO-BAJA.                                            *         
      ******************************************************************        
       2200-PROCESO-BAJA.                                                       
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2200-PROCESO-BAJA'                                
      *F*                                                                       
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-INI                                                    
           MOVE X372MCOA-ANIO-E             TO CCV0-ANIO                        
           MOVE X372MCOA-KEXPEDIENTE-E      TO CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE                 
      * MU-2017-BDGI-R-V-FIN                                                    

           EXEC SQL                                                             
              DELETE                                                            
                 FROM TB372CCV0                                                 
                 WHERE CCV0_ANIO        = :CCV0-ANIO                            
                   AND CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE = :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE                     
                   AND CCV0_NCOA       >= :CCV0-NCOA                            
           END-EXEC.                                                            
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'SQLCODE : ' SQLCODE                                         
      *F*                                                                       

           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.                                        
           IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND                                     
              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                           
              MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-OTHER  TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                   
              MOVE 'B372MCOA'           TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S                  
              MOVE SQLCODE              TO XN-SQLCODE                           
              MOVE 'ERROR AL BORRAR REGISTRO EN TB372CCV0'                      
                                        TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                     
           ELSE                                                                 
              MOVE 'SE HA ELIMINADO CORRECTAMENTE EL EXPEDIENTE'                
                                        TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                     
           END-IF.                                                              

      ******************************************************************        
      * 2300-PROCESO-MODIF                                                      
      ******************************************************************        
       2300-PROCESO-MODIF.                                                      
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2300-PROCESO-MODIF'                               
      *F*                                                                       

             EXEC SQL                                                           
               UPDATE TB372CCV0                                                 
                SET CCV0_ANIO             =:CCV0-ANIO            ,              
                    CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE      =:CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE     ,              
                    CCV0_NCOA             =:CCV0-NCOA            ,              
                    CCV0_CODCOA           =:CCV0-CODCOA          ,              
                    CCV0_PORCOA           =:CCV0-PORCOA          ,              
                    CCV0_IMPCOA           =:CCV0-IMPCOA          ,              
                    CCV0_IMPRTOINTEGRCOA  =:CCV0-IMPRTOINTEGRCOA ,              
                    CCV0_IMPREDPRICOA     =:CCV0-IMPREDPRICOA    ,              
                    CCV0_IMPREDTRANCOA    =:CCV0-IMPREDTRANCOA   ,              
                    CCV0_IMPRTONETOCOA    =:CCV0-IMPRTONETOCOA   ,              
                    CCV0_IMPRETCOA        =:CCV0-IMPRETCOA       ,              
                    CCV0_IMPCOMPENSATCOA  =:CCV0-IMPCOMPENSATCOA                
               WHERE CCV0_ANIO        = :CCV0-ANIO                              
                 AND CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE = :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE                       
                 AND CCV0_NCOA        = :CCV0-NCOA                              
             END-EXEC                                                           
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'SQLCODE : ' SQLCODE                                         
      *F*                                                                       

           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.                                        
           IF NOT DB2-OK                                                        
              SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                           
              IF DB2-NOTFND                                                     
                 MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-NOTFND TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                
                 MOVE 'B372MCOA'           TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S               
                 MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN CON LOS PARAMETROS        
      -               ' INFORMADOS'                                             
                                           TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                  
              ELSE                                                              
                 MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-OTHER  TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                
                 MOVE 'B372MCOA'           TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S               
                 MOVE SQLCODE              TO XN-SQLCODE                        
                 MOVE 'ERROR AL ACTUALIZAR EN TB372CCV0'                        
                                           TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                  
              END-IF                                                            
           ELSE                                                                 
              MOVE 'EXPEDIENTE MODIFICADO CORRECTAMENTE'                        
                TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                                             
           END-IF                                                               
           .                                                                    
      **************************************************************            
      * 2400-PROCESO-CONSULTA                                      *            
      **************************************************************            
      *                                                                         
       2400-PROCESO-CONSULTA.                                                   
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2400-PROCESO-CONSULTA'                            
      *F*                                                                       

           PERFORM 8000-INFORMAR-CONSULTAS                                      
           IF X372MCOA-NCOA-E = ZEROS                                           
              PERFORM 2420-PROCESO-CURSOR                                       
           ELSE                                                                 
              PERFORM 2410-PROCESO-SELECT                                       
           END-IF.                                                              

      **************************************************************            
      * 2410-PROCESO-SELECT.                                       *            
      **************************************************************            
      *                                                                         
       2410-PROCESO-SELECT.                                                     
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2410-PROCESO-SELECT'                              
      *F*                                                                       

            EXEC SQL                                                            
                SELECT                                                          
                      CCV0_ANIO             ,                                   
                      CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE      ,                                   
                      CCV0_NCOA             ,                                   
                      CCV0_CODCOA           ,                                   
                      CCV0_PORCOA           ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPCOA           ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPRTOINTEGRCOA  ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPREDPRICOA     ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPREDTRANCOA    ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPRTONETOCOA    ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPRETCOA        ,                                   
                      CCV0_IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                      
                INTO                                                            
                     :CCV0-ANIO            ,                                    
                     :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE     ,                                    
                     :CCV0-NCOA            ,                                    
                     :CCV0-CODCOA          ,                                    
                     :CCV0-PORCOA          ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPCOA          ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPRTOINTEGRCOA ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPREDPRICOA    ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPREDTRANCOA   ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPRTONETOCOA   ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPRETCOA       ,                                    
                     :CCV0-IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                      
                FROM TB372CCV0                                                  
               WHERE   CCV0_ANIO             = :CCV0-ANIO                       
                 AND   CCV0_KEXPEDIENTE      = :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE                
                 AND   CCV0_NCOA             = :CCV0-NCOA                       
            END-EXEC.                                                           
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'SQLCODE : ' SQLCODE                                         
      *F*                                                                       

           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2                                         

           IF DB2-OK                                                            
              MOVE 1 TO XN-I                                                    
              PERFORM 5000-MOVER-SALIDA                                         
           ELSE                                                                 
              SET  ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                          
              EVALUATE TRUE                                                     
                WHEN DB2-NOTFND                                                 
                     MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-NOTFND                                  
                       TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                                    
                     MOVE 'B372MCOA'                                            
                       TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S                                   
                     MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN LOS CRITERIOS         
      -                   ' SELECCIONADOS'                                      
                       TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                                      
                WHEN DB2-SELECTDUP                                              
                     MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-CLVDUPLI                                
                       TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                                    
                     MOVE 'B372MCOA'                                            
                       TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S                                   
                     MOVE 'EXITEN MAS DE UN EXPEDIENTE CON LOS DATOS            
      -                   ' INFORMADOS'                                         
                       TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                                      
                WHEN OTHER                                                      
                     MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-OTHER                                   
                       TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S                                    
                     MOVE 'ERROR AL OBTENER LOS EXPEDIENTES'                    
                       TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                                      
                     MOVE 'B372MCOA'                                            
                       TO  X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S                                  
              END-EVALUATE                                                      
           END-IF.                                                              

      *********************************************************                 
      *2420-PROCESO-CURSOR.                                                     
      *********************************************************                 
      *                                                                         
       2420-PROCESO-CURSOR.                                                     
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2420-PROCESO-CURSOR'                              
      *F*                                                                       

      *INICIALIZAMOS LOS SWITCH DEL CONTROL DE CURSOR                           

           SET PRIMERA-LECTURA TO TRUE.                                         
           SET NO-CURSOR-OK    TO TRUE.                                         

      *ABRIMOS EL CURSOR                                                        

           IF NOT ERROR-GRAVE                                                   
              PERFORM 2425-ABRIR-CURSOR                                         
           END-IF.                                                              

           MOVE 1 TO XN-I                                                       
           PERFORM 2430-LEER-FILA                                               
                   UNTIL DB2-NOTFND                                             
                   OR ERROR-GRAVE                                               
                   OR XN-I > CN-RES-MAX                                         

      *SI EL CURSOR SE ABRIO CORRECTAMENTE SE CIERRA                            

           IF CURSOR-OK                                                         
              PERFORM 2435-CERRAR-CURSOR                                        
           END-IF.                                                              

      ********************************************************                  
       2425-ABRIR-CURSOR.                                                       
      ******************************************************************        

      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2425-ABRIR-CURSOR'                                
      *F*                                                                       
           EXEC SQL OPEN C1 END-EXEC.                                           
           MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.                                        
           IF NOT DB2-OK                                                        
      *       MOVE 'N' TO X372M004-SPAGINACION-S                                
              SET ERROR-GRAVE                 TO TRUE                           
              MOVE '99'                       TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S             
              MOVE 'ERROR AL ABRIR CURSOR C1' TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S               
              MOVE 'B372MCOA'                 TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S            
           ELSE                                                                 
              SET CURSOR-OK   TO TRUE                                           
           END-IF.                                                              

      ***************************************************************           
       2430-LEER-FILA.                                                          
      ******************************************************************        

      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'B372MCOA: 2430-LEER-FILA'                                   
      *F*                                                                       
            EXEC SQL                                                            
                  FETCH C1                                                      
                  INTO :CCV0-ANIO            ,                                  
                       :CCV0-KEXPEDIENTE     ,                                  
                       :CCV0-NCOA            ,                                  
                       :CCV0-CODCOA          ,                                  
                       :CCV0-PORCOA          ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPCOA          ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPRTOINTEGRCOA ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPREDPRICOA    ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPREDTRANCOA   ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPRTONETOCOA   ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPRETCOA       ,                                  
                       :CCV0-IMPCOMPENSATCOA                                    
            END-EXEC.                                                           
      *D*                                                                       
DSPLYS*    DISPLAY 'SQLCODE : ' SQLCODE                                         
      *F*                                                                       

            MOVE SQLCODE TO SW-ERROR-DB2.                                       
      *SI NO DEVUELVE NOTFND NI CERO, INFORMAMOS ERROR GRAVE                    
            IF NOT DB2-OK AND NOT DB2-NOTFND                                    

               SET ERROR-GRAVE                    TO TRUE                       
               MOVE '99'                          TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S         
               MOVE 'ERROR AL CONSULTAR CURSOR C1' TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S          
               MOVE 'B372MCOA'                    TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S        

            ELSE                                                                

               IF DB2-OK AND XN-I <= CN-RES-MAX                                 
      * DESPUES DE HACER LA PRIMERA LECTURA MOVEMOS NO AL SWITCH                
                  IF PRIMERA-LECTURA                                            
                     SET NO-PRIMERA-LECTURA TO TRUE                             
                  END-IF                                                        

      * MOVEMOS LOS REGISTROS A LA COPY DE SALIDA. INCREMENTAMOS INDICE         
                  PERFORM 5000-MOVER-SALIDA                                     
                  ADD 1       TO XN-I                                           
                  MOVE ZEROES TO SW-ERROR-DB2                                   

               ELSE                                                             
      * UN SQLCODE = 100 EN LA PRIMERA LECTURA DEL CURSOR ES UN ERROR  -03      
                  IF PRIMERA-LECTURA AND DB2-NOTFND                             
                     SET ERROR-GRAVE TO TRUE                                    
                     MOVE LT-RETURN-ERR-NOTFND TO X372MCOA-RETORNO-S            
                     MOVE 'B372M004' TO X372MCOA-GNOMPROG-S                     
                     MOVE 'NO HAY EXPEDIENTES QUE CUMPLAN LOS CRITERIOS         
      -                   ' SELECCIONADOS'                                      
                       TO X372MCOA-ERROR-S                                      
                  END-IF                                                        

               END-IF                                                           
            END-IF.                                                             

